# The SMLib/SM_API C++ reference solidcore is difftested against: the SolidCraft fork of
# SMLib (tangency-labs/smlib), which is usd-brep v1.0.1 (3fd5b95, what solidcore was ported
# from) plus the fork's changes, the generic blend among them (AGENTS.md §4b, #2502).
# Single source of truth for the pin: scripts/cpp-ref-key.sh, scripts/fetch-cpp.sh,
# scripts/package-cpp-ref.sh, scripts/check-production-wire.py, site/build.py,
# harness/callgraph/write_closure.py and the CI workflows (via
# .github/actions/cpp-reference and cpp-reference.yml) all read it. Plain KEY=VALUE lines:
# sourceable by sh, appendable to $GITHUB_ENV, parsed by Python. Moving the pin changes
# the scripts/cpp-ref-key.sh key, so a new prebuilt C++ reference must be published
# (.github/workflows/cpp-reference.yml runs on push to main when this file changes).
UPSTREAM_REPO=https://github.com/tangency-labs/smlib
UPSTREAM_VERSION=1.1.0-alpha
UPSTREAM_COMMIT=a18bbe523b9c7819f1a9da8c40a54c15f9936125
# What solidcore was ported from. harness/callgraph/units.json (each unit's functions, files
# and lines) was extracted there, so the site links those lines to this commit.
PORTED_FROM_REPO=https://github.com/NVIDIA-Omniverse/usd-brep
PORTED_FROM_VERSION=1.0.1
PORTED_FROM_COMMIT=3fd5b9548d19aa8c12c29bc9637a96d42a06f8a5
